Cell["\<\
Figure 4.5a  Arctic tern \[LongDash] monthly centroids with their 95% \
block-bootstrap confidence ellipses (resampling years with replacement). The \
contrast is the point: the ocean-crossing months reach a mean 95%-ellipse \
radius of about 17.7\[Degree] over the open Atlantic, but tighten to ~1.1\
\[Degree] at the densely-watched Greenland/Iceland breeding grounds.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.35],ExpressionUUID->"b86eaadb-0c5b-4363-92af-79750edc35ec"],

