Cell[TextData[{
 "Figure 4.5c  Red knot \[LongDash] the Americas flyway. ",
 StyleBox["The honest reading of a centroid map:",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " trust the tight months, treat the sprawling ones as directional, not \
precise. (Ellipse radii are mean centre-to-edge distances in degrees, \
combining latitude and longitude.)"
}], "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.35],ExpressionUUID->"c6fd7979-c582-42a3-b667-32abf144db75"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["5.  Animating the population centroid", "Section",
 FontFamily->"Roboto Condensed",
 FontSize->30,
 FontColor->RGBColor[
  0.153, 0.51, 0.64],ExpressionUUID->"b0f38afa-d0e1-450f-87b2-ba275c306363"],

Cell["\<\
Stringing the twelve monthly centroids together and interpolating along great \
circles between them turns the static loops of \[Section]4 into the animated \
comet-trail globe shown at the top of this post. Each species' centre of mass \
glides through the year over its faint annual route \[LongDash] the most \
compact possible summary of \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]where is this population, \
right now, on average.\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"7393f675-eae7-48d3-a649-27f56d5fc9db"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We can also quantify each loop. Summing the great-circle distances between \
consecutive monthly centroids (over observed months only) gives the ",
 StyleBox["annual centroid displacement",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " \[LongDash] how far the centre of mass travels in a year:"
}], "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"9cbd9f0c-da8a-4725-879d-b5af59f0f46d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
(* Annual centroid displacement per primary flyway track. *)
pl = Import[FileNameJoin[{$BFPDataDir, \"path_lengths.csv\"}], \"CSV\"];
prim = Select[Rest[pl], ! StringContainsQ[#[[3]], \"global\", IgnoreCase -> \
True] &];
BarChart[prim[[All, 4]],
   ChartLabels -> (Style[#[[2]] <> \"\\n(\" <> #[[3]] <> \")\", 10] & /@ prim),
   BarOrigin -> Left,
   PlotLabel -> Style[
     \"Annual centroid displacement (km) -- NOT individual journey \
distance\", 13],
   ImageSize -> 780, AspectRatio -> 0.5]\
\>", "Input",
 CellMargins->{{60, 30}, {6, 6}},
 FontSize->11,ExpressionUUID->"69db6500-a477-4c40-90b2-bf1484fd81f0"],

