for privacy."
}], "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"f92d29ee-f87b-483b-a98a-f05a6e68076e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Tools.",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " All numerics, maps, and animations are pure ",
 StyleBox["Wolfram Language",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ". The notebook was assembled programmatically via ",
 StyleBox["wolframscript",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 ". No AI-generated illustrations are used anywhere in this post; every \
figure is computed from data."
}], "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"9ae05930-71cb-47b0-a1ee-6255f4647899"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["15.  Reproducibility", "Section",
 FontFamily->"Roboto Condensed",
 FontSize->30,
 FontColor->RGBColor[
  0.153, 0.51, 0.64],ExpressionUUID->"10eb16cc-5356-4133-befa-e93078585b3e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "All source code lives in the public repository ",
 StyleBox["github.com/mthiel74/BirdFlightPaths",
  FontWeight->"SemiBold"],
 " (",
 StyleBox["https://github.com/mthiel74/BirdFlightPaths",
  FontFamily->"Courier",
  FontSize->10],
 ")",
 ". The pipeline is pure Wolfram Language; the ",
 StyleBox[".wls",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 " scripts are the source of truth, and the committed ",
 StyleBox[".nb",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 " is browseable without running anything. To rebuild from scratch on a \
machine with Wolfram Language installed (plus, for the optional \[Section]9 \
validation, R with the ",
 StyleBox["ebirdst",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 " package):"
}], "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"a5b14ab5-c520-4ff9-88c4-babbdf5e2f68"],

Cell["\<\
# 1. Mint citable GBIF downloads (DOIs) + fetch full occurrence CSVs
wolframscript -file wolfram/gbif_download.wls

# 2. Centroids, seasonal maps, centroid-track globes, hero animation
wolframscript -file wolfram/run_all.wls

# 3. (optional, private) S&T cross-check via R / ebirdst -- stays local
wolframscript -file wolfram/ebirdst_r.wls

# 4. Build this notebook (bird_migration.nb + .pdf)
wolframscript -file community/build_notebook.wls\
\>", "Program",
 CellMargins->{{60, 30}, {6, 6}},
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 FontFamily->"Courier",
 FontSize->11,
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.95, 0.96, 0.98],ExpressionUUID->"2cd0b686-cfaa-4a93-8d40-a5a26f9b7392"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["GBIF download DOIs.",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " The citable DOIs minted by step 1 are recorded in ",
 StyleBox["data/gbif_dois.json",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 ": Arctic tern \[LongDash] ",
 StyleBox["https://doi.org/10.15468/dl.87f228",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 "; common swift \[LongDash] ",
 StyleBox["https://doi.org/10.15468/dl.pkrrb6",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 "; red knot \[LongDash] ",
 StyleBox["https://doi.org/10.15468/dl.3kmcbn",
  FontFamily->"Courier"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"f16d8d8c-4d44-47c6-ac49-d6c07ea9aacc"],

